{"seq":1,"slug":"the-yangming-school","title":"The Yangming School","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/wang-yangming/influence-and-legacy/the-yangming-school","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"disciples-and-branches","title":"弟子与流派","url":"/c/people/wang-yangming/influence-and-legacy/the-yangming-school/disciples-and-branches","wordCount":1855,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-taizhou-school","title":"泰州学派","url":"/c/people/wang-yangming/influence-and-legacy/the-yangming-school/the-taizhou-school","wordCount":1729,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"本章呈现王阳明心学在中国的传承。王阳明门下弟子众多、人才辈出，在他身后形成了浙中、江右、泰州等众多流派，史称\"阳明学派\"。其中，泰州学派以\"百姓日用即道\"的平民精神独树一帜。更重要的是，王阳明心学以\"心即理\"\"良知人人具足\"高扬人的道德主体性，对僵化的程朱理学正统构成了有力冲击，蕴含着深刻的思想解放意义，乃至成为近代思想启蒙的先声。\n"}